doc:Factsarticle1_23 schema:abstract "The ability to preemptively identify potential failures in industrial parts is crucial for minimizing downtime, reducing maintenance costs and ensuring system reliability and safety. This study proposes a combined Logistic Model Tree Forest and Stacked Long Short-Term Memory approach with ENN-SMOTE preprocessing for fault prediction." .
